{
  "info": {
    "name": "EFSRT V - Coleccion completa (issue 8.4)",
    "description": "Coleccion unica que reune todos los endpoints de los 6 microservicios, organizados en carpetas, todo a traves del API Gateway (puerto 8080) -- nunca directo a un microservicio, igual que en produccion. Usa el environment 'EFSRT V - Local' (variable baseUrl). Las variables jwt* se completan solas al correr la carpeta '0. Auth' primero. Pensada para correrse completa con Newman: npx newman run coleccion-completa.postman_collection.json -e EFSRT-V-Local.postman_environment.json",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth",
      "description": "Login/registro + gestion de usuarios (auth-service)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar paciente nuevo (demo) -> 201",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombres\": \"Postman\",\n  \"apellidos\": \"Demo Paciente\",\n  \"email\": \"postman.paciente@gestion.pe\",\n  \"password\": \"Gestion2026\",\n  \"telefono\": \"999111222\",\n  \"rol\": \"PACIENTE\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 o 409 si ya existe (rerun)', () => pm.expect([201,409]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login PACIENTE (demo: Lucia Quispe) -> 200",
